 "source": "Accurate Online sandbox (ACC_DB=manufaktur), seeded and captured 2026-10-19 (P3.6). Pencatatan Gaji (accurate__cash-bank__employee-payment) EPY.2050.01/02/03/12.00001 for placeholder employees NL-PY50-E1 (TK0), E2 (K1), E3 (K3), joined 01/01/2050, placeholder NPWP 0000000000000000. Line amounts come from Accurate's own calculate-employee-payment.do (the form's server-side calculation), saved through save-employee-payment.do. PPh 21: Jan-Nov TER (PP 58/2023) on gross less Pengurangan Gaji, rounded; December recomputes the year with Pasal 17 and withholds the difference (negative = Kelebihan Pajak). TER tables A/B/C were checked against calculate-employee-payment.do at both ends and the middle of every bracket (375 probes, 0 mismatches), the annual rules with 11 December probes (PTKP, biaya jabatan 5% capped 6.000.000, iuran pensiun pekerja, Pengurangan Gaji, JKM, Pasal 17 up to 35%). Fees used: only those with an expense account in the demo master (Tunjangan Jabatan, JKM and Iuran Bulanan have none and cannot be saved); pension and health payables posted to 210206. NL-PY50-D1 masks the demo data payment EPY.2021.06.00001 (demo employee E.00001, manual PPh under pre-TER rules); it only feeds the Gaji Karyawan per Tahun 2021 bar. Accurate's pphAmount/exceedPphAmount are stored here as one signed pph.",
